#, fuzzy
msgid "Where Postulo knows a country's addresses, a postcode has to be in the form that country uses, and an address with a street or a postcode cannot leave empty the parts every address there has. A town and a country alone are kept as a place. Spaces, hyphens and capital letters in a postcode are put right as you save: 1000100 is kept as 1000-100. Nothing checks that an address exists, and a country Postulo has no rules for is free-form."
msgstr "Kjer Postulo pozna naslove države, mora biti poštna številka v obliki, ki jo ta država uporablja, naslov z ulico ali poštno številko pa ne sme pustiti praznih delov, ki jih ima vsak tamkajšnji naslov. Samo mesto in država se shranita kot kraj. Presledki, vezaji in velike črke v poštni številki se popravijo ob shranjevanju: 1000100 se shrani kot 1000-100. Nič ne preverja, ali naslov obstaja, država, za katero Postulo nima pravil, pa je prostoformatna."

